Review verdict GAPS_FOUND; all six findings applied:
1+2. extract_rows falls back to the liveness lint's walk_rows when no
   top-level rows list exists — row location now matches the lint's row
   concept, and the SHIPPED path reproduces the published corpus FP
   numbers exactly (401 files, 0 CRITICAL, 3 WARN, 100 witness-missing).
3. Mid-write/missing-out skips land in the state file per
   SCENARIO-CONDUCTOR-SENTINEL-1-MIDWRITE-RACE as written.
4. Missing out file gets a durable note; relative --out resolves
   against /proc/<pid>/cwd.
5. Wiring asserts ignore comment lines (commented-out call reads absent).
6. Fingerprint no longer drops GPU index 0 (falsy-zero class).

Mutation 10 proven: walk_rows fallback removed -> nested-rows test RED,
restored -> 39 GREEN. Live dry-run clean; the new missing-out note fired
truthfully on the live A/B whose first row is not yet written.

